# Raw model output and job records. Regenerated by `npm run assets:fetch` from the request ids
# in docs/GENERATION-LOG.md; never shipped. Vault 4.16 depends on this being absent on a fresh
# clone: a declared input that cannot be found must fail the build, not substitute.
_generated/

